[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Caro-Kann Defence"]
[Variation "Advance Variation, Short Variation"]
[ECO "B12"]
[Character "solid,positional"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "c5-break,good-bishop"]

1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 Bf5 { Out before e6, as always in the Caro-Kann. } 4. Nf3 e6 5. Be2 c5 { Hits the base of
White's pawn chain. } 6. Be3 { Defends d4 twice, so ...cxd4 gives White nothing. } 6... cxd4 7. Nxd4 Ne7 { Ready to meet Nxf5 with a knight recapture, so the bishop pair is not given away. } *
